  "starterCode": "# Full Forward Pass — reconstructed educational contract\nimport numpy as np\n\ndef solution(token_embeddings, position_embeddings, layer_attention_outputs, layer_ffn_outputs, output_weights):\n    # TODO: implement the operation described in the problem statement\n    pass\n",
  "solution": "### 💡 Intuition & Approach\nThe implementation computes **Full Forward Pass** by following direct architectural principles, leveraging vectorized operations to ensure both correctness and optimal runtime efficiency.\n\n### ⚡ Python Reference Implementation\n```python\nimport numpy as np\ndef solution(token_embeddings, position_embeddings, layer_attention_outputs, layer_ffn_outputs, output_weights):\n    # Educational forward pass from supplied embeddings and per-layer submodule outputs.\n    h=np.asarray(token_embeddings,dtype=float)+np.asarray(position_embeddings,dtype=float)\n    for a,f in zip(layer_attention_outputs,layer_ffn_outputs):\n        h=h+np.asarray(a,dtype=float)+np.asarray(f,dtype=float)\n    return (h@np.asarray(output_weights,dtype=float)).tolist()\n```\n\n### ⏱️ Complexity Analysis\n- **Time Complexity**: $\\mathcal{O}(N)$ where $N$ represents the primary sequence length or dimension.\n- **Space Complexity**: $\\mathcal{O}(N)$ auxiliary memory for computing and storing output representations.",
